# This repository shares its root with a general workspace.
# Track only the Pocket Approve project.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!REPORT.md
!ROADMAP.md
!SECURITY.md
!LICENSE
!pocket-approve/
!pocket-approve/**

# Secrets and generated state stay out even after the project folder exists.
pocket-approve/node_modules/
pocket-approve/data/
pocket-approve/.env
pocket-approve/.env.*
pocket-approve/**/*.pem
pocket-approve/**/*.key
pocket-approve/**/*.crt
pocket-approve/**/vapid.json
pocket-approve/**/subscriptions.json
pocket-approve/**/token
